    "code": "\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectInView? THEN\n\t\t\tDO ApproachObject\n\tELSE\n\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\t\tIF IsObjectWithinRange? THEN\n\t\t\t\tDO GrabObject\n\t\tELSE\n\t\t\tDO InspectObject\n\t\t\tDO SpecificTask\n\t\tEND\n\t\tDO MoveToDestination\n\tEND\n"
